#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create activities in the CRM to ensure you're keeping track of open "
"opportunities"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງກິດຈະກຳໃນ CRM ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕາມໂອກາດທາງທຸລະກິດທີ່ຍັງເປີດຢູ່ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Did you know you can also get a full <strong>Accounting</strong> suite in "
"Odoo?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຮູ້ບໍ່ວ່າ ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ລະບົບ <strong>ການບັນຊີ</strong> ແບບຄົບວົງຈອນໃນ Odoo ໄດ້ຄືກັນ?"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
