#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Explore extra Odoo apps that might be interesting for your specific "
"business, they're all included in your subscription !"
msgstr ""
"ສຳຫຼວດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Odoo ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ອາດໜ້າສົນໃຈສຳລັບທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ ເຊິ່ງລວມຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດສະມາຊິກຂອງທ່"
"ານແລ້ວ!"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Field Service Documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານຄູ່ມືການບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມ"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model:pos.config,name:food_trucks.pos_config_1
