#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Handle all your customers in a breeze and get a nice overview of your income "
"through the reporting features that are integrated in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການລູກຄ້າທຸກຄົນໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ເບິ່ງພາບລວມລາຍຮັບຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານລະບົບການລາຍງານທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ Odoo."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If applicable, you can invoice your presence to your customer through the "
"invoice app. You can configure your invoice templates to include terms &amp; "
"conditions, as well as other handy features."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີ, ທ່ານສາມາດອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ສຳລັບການໃຫ້ບໍລິການແກ່ລູກຄ້າຜ່ານແອັບໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບໃບແຈ້"
"ງໜີ້ໃຫ້ລວມມີເງື່ອນໄຂ &amp; ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ລວມເຖິງຟັງຊັນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If applicable, you can of course directly manage your events directly in the "
"Field service app without going through the CRM and Sales app."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີ, ທ່ານແນ່ນອນສາມາດຈັດການງານຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນແອັບບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຜ່ານແອັບ "
"CRM ແລະ ແອັບການຂາຍ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to easily discover every features of this package, try "
"downloading the Demo Data."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການທົດລອງໃຊ້ທຸກໆ ຟັງຊັນຂອງແພັກເກດນີ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ລອງດາວໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ (Demo Data)."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In some cases, you will get bookings from customers (coporate, etc.) for you "
"to attend an company event or other similar events."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຈອງຈາກລູກຄ້າ (ບໍລິສັດ, ອົງກອນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ເພື່ອໄປຮ່ວມງານຂອງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື "
"ງານອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Incoming opportunities can be registered into your CRM. Manage opportunity "
"stages in the kanban view, categorization using tags, to-do's and reminders "
"using activities, and communication through the chatter."
msgstr ""
"ໂອກາດທາງທຸລະກິດໃໝ່ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າໃນ CRM ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ຈັດການຂັ້ນຕອນໂອກາດໃນຮູບແບບກະດານ "
"(Kanban), ຈັດໝວດໝູ່ດ້ວຍປ້າຍກຳກັບ, ສ້າງລາຍການທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດ ແລະ ແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານກິດຈະກຳ, ລວມທັງການຕິດ"
"ຕໍ່ສື່ສານຜ່ານຊ່ອງສົນທະນາ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Install the <strong>Social Marketing App </strong>to manage your social "
"media presence."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ <strong>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍ</strong> ເພື່ອຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍຂອງທ່"
"ານ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Invoice your customers using the <strong>Invoice app</strong>"
msgstr "ອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້</strong>"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Invoicing Documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານຄູ່ມືການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Just be careful, once demo data are uploaded, it cannot be easily deleted. "
"But you can restart a fresh database on"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍໃຫ້ລະວັງ, ເມື່ອໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ງ່າຍ. ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທີ່"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Manage your <strong>Purchases and Inventory</strong> in Odoo as well."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການ <strong>ການຈັດຊື້ ແລະ ສາງສິນຄ້າ</strong> ຂອງທ່ານໃນ Odoo ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your presence at events using the <strong>Field Service app</strong>"
msgstr "ຈັດການການໄປຮ່ວມງານຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມ</strong>"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model:crm.tag,name:food_trucks.crm_tag_7
msgid "Multi-Day"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍມື້"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Need a Website? No problem, Odoo can do it as well."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການເວັບໄຊບໍ? ບໍ່ມີບັນຫາ, Odoo ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo.com/trial"
msgstr "Odoo.com/trial"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once you have all the information regarding this opportunity, you can make a "
"new quotation. Define how long you'll be staying, and if relevant, other "
"things you will be charging to the customer."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບໂອກາດນີ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໃໝ່ໄດ້. ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ທ່ານຈະໄ"
"ປໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ລາຍການອື່ນໆ ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຊິ່ງຈະເກັບເງິນນຳລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Point of Sale Documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານຄູ່ມືລະບົບໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS)"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Sales Documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານຄູ່ມືການຂາຍ"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Send quotations to prospective customers through the <strong>Sales app</"
"strong>"
msgstr "ສົ່ງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າທີ່ຄາດຫວັງຜ່ານ <strong>ແອັບການຂາຍ</strong>"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:food_trucks.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "Soft dependency"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Take a look at the <strong>Email Marketing App</strong> to let past "
"customers know what you're up to !"
msgstr ""
"ລອງເບິ່ງ <strong>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ</strong> ເພື່ອແຈ້ງຂ່າວສານໃໝ່ໆ ໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າເກົ່າຂອງທ່ານຮັບຊ"
"າບ!"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid "Use the <strong>CRM app</strong> to manage your opportunities"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong> ເພື່ອຈັດການໂອກາດທາງທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When your prospective customer confirms the sale, a new task is created in "
"your field service app, and linked back to your sale order. You can manage "
"assignations, needs, and so on from there and obtain a handy overview of "
"your\n"
"        planning."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລູກຄ້າທີ່ຄາດຫວັງຢືນຢັນການສັ່ງຊື້, ໜ້າວຽກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນແອັບບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍ"
"ງກັບຄືນຫາໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການການມອບໝາຍວຽກ, ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ສິ່ງອື່ນໆ ໄດ້ຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ ພ້ອ"
"ມທັງເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງ\n"
"        ແຜນການຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While on the field, you can take orders and payments from your customers or "
"from the attendees through the Point of Sale app. The app is a fully "
"featured point-of-sale solution that supports menus, products, quantities, "
"discounts,\n"
"        pricelists, custom notes, and many other features."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໃຫ້ບໍລິການ, ທ່ານສາມາດຮັບອໍເດີ ແລະ ຮັບເງິນຈາກລູກຄ້າ ຫຼື ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມງານຜ່ານແອັບລະບົບໜ້າຮ້າ"
"ນ (POS). ແອັບດັ່ງກ່າວເປັນໂຊລູຊັນລະບົບໜ້າຮ້ານທີ່ຄົບວົງຈອນ ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບທັງລາຍການເມນູ, ສິນຄ້າ, ຈຳນວນ, "
"ສ່ວນຫຼຸດ,\n"
"        ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາ, ໝາຍເຫດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນອື່ນໆ ອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ."

#. module: food_trucks
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_trucks.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With the Food Trucks Industry Package, you have all you need to manage your "
"business from customer bookings to invoicing, including a point-of-sale "
"system and much more."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍຊຸດແພັກເກດທຸລະກິດລົດຂາຍອາຫານ, ທ່ານມີທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການຈັດການທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການຈອງຂອ"
"ງລູກຄ້າຈົນເຖິງການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້, ລວມທັງລະບົບໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ."

